  "question": "Which attraction is nearest in the northeast direction from Xtreme Action Park, Fort Lauderdale, FL?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-80.153423 26.191598)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois,origin\nWHERE pois.tourism = 'attraction'\nAND degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 22.5 AND 67.5\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> origin.geometry ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
